"parts":[{"text":"பேண்","lemma":"pēṇ","gloss":"to regard/care for"},{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ār","gloss":"negative third person plural suffix"}],"gloss":"who do not regard"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மாறுநின்று","parts":[{"text":"மாறு","lemma":"māṟu","gloss":"opposition"},{"text":"நின்று","lemma":"niṉṟu","gloss":"standing"}],"gloss":"standing in opposition"},{"surface":"இறந்த","parts":[{"text":"இறந்த","lemma":"இறந்த","gloss":"who died"}],"gloss":"who died","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஆறுசெல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆறு","lemma":"āṟu","gloss":"path"},{"text":"செல்","lemma":"cel","gloss":"to go"}],"gloss":"path-going"},{"surface":"வம்பலர்","parts":[{"text":"வம்பலர்","lemma":"vampalar","gloss":"travelers/strangers"}],"gloss":"travelers"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உவலிடு","parts":[{"text":"உவல்","lemma":"uval","gloss":"dry leaves"},{"text":"இடு","lemma":"iṭu","gloss":"to place"}],"gloss":"covered with dry leaves"},{"surface":"பதுக்கை","parts":[{"text":"பதுக்கை","lemma":"patukkai","gloss":"stone-cairn grave"}],"gloss":"stone-cairn grave"},{"surface":"ஊரின்","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ūr","gloss":"town/village"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"comparison suffix 'like'"}],"gloss":"like a town"},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"tōṉṟu","gloss":"to appear"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"habitual suffix"}],"gloss":"appears"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கல்லுயர்","parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"kal","gloss":"stone/mountain"},{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"uyar","gloss":"high"}],"gloss":"high with rocks"},{"surface":"நனந்தலை","parts":[{"text":"நனம்","lemma":"naṉam","gloss":"wide"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"talai","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"wide expanse"},{"surface":"நல்ல","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"nal","gloss":"good"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"plural neuter suffix"}],"gloss":"good things"},{"surface":"கூறி","parts":[{"text":"கூறு","lemma":"kūṟu","gloss":"to say"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having spoken"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புணர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"புணர்ந்து","lemma":"புணர்ந்து","gloss":"having joined"}],"gloss":"having joined","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உடன்","parts":[{"text":"உடன்","lemma":"uṭaṉ","gloss":"together"}],"gloss":"together"},{"surface":"போதல்","parts":[{"text":"போ","lemma":"pō","gloss":"to go"},{"text":"தல்","lemma":"tal","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"going"},{"surface":"பொருள்","parts":[{"text":"பொருள்","lemma":"poruḷ","gloss":"purpose/wealth"}],"gloss":"purpose"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"as/that"}],"gloss":"as"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உணர்ந்தேன்","parts":[{"text":"உணர்ந்தேன்","lemma":"உணர்ந்தேன்","gloss":"I realized"}],"gloss":"I realized","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"maṉṟa","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"avar","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"உணரா","parts":[{"text":"உணர்","lemma":"uṇar","gloss":"to realize"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"not realizing"},{"surface":"ஊங்கே","parts":[{"text":"ஊங்கு","lemma":"ūṅku","gloss":"before"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"before"}]}],"literal":"Those warriors with curved bows who rub the beautiful edges of their bows, / armed with sharp, long arrows, disregarding even powerful foes, / the travelers going on the path who died standing in opposition to them, / their stone-cairns covered with dry leaves appear like a town. / In such a wide expanse high with rocks, speaking sweet words, / to go together in union is the true purpose, / indeed, I realized this, even before he could realize it!","translation":"The fierce highwaymen with curved bows rub the tips of their bows. Armed with sharp, long arrows, they disregard even powerful foes. The travelers who stood against them and died on the path are buried under stone-cairns covered with dry leaves, which are so numerous they look like a village. In this vast, rocky wasteland, to go together in union, speaking sweet words of comfort, is the only true wealth. Indeed, I realized this even before he did!","modern":"வில்லின் நுனியைத் தடவிப் பார்க்கும் வளைந்த வில்லையுடைய மறவர்கள், கூர்மையான நீண்ட அம்புகளைக் கொண்டு, தம்முடைய வலிமையான பகைவர்களையும் மதியாமல் போர் செய்வர். அவர்களுக்கு எதிராக நின்று போரிட்டு மடிந்த வழிப்போக்கர்களின் உடல்கள் மீது எழுப்பப்பட்ட, காய்ந்த இலைகளால் மூடப்பட்ட கல் பதுக்கைகள் (கல்லறைகள்) ஒரு பெரிய ஊரைப் போலக் காட்சியளிக்கின்றன. அத்தகைய கற்கள் நிறைந்த உயர்ந்த அகன்ற காட்டு வழியில், ஒருவருக்கொருவர் நல்ல சொற்களைக் கூறி, இணைந்தே உடன் போவதுதான் உண்மையான பொருள் (செல்வம்) என்பதை, அவர் உணர்வதற்கு முன்னரே நான் உறுதியாக உணர்ந்து கொண்டேன்.","explanation":"In this poem, the heroine's friend (tōṉi) reflects on the decision of elopement (uṭaṉpōkku) through a perilous desert path. She describes the terrifying landscape where fierce highwaymen with curved bows and sharp arrows kill travelers, whose graves are so numerous they look like a village. Yet, she asserts that traversing this dangerous, rocky wasteland together, comforting each other with sweet words, is the ultimate purpose and true wealth of life. The image of the graves appearing like a town vividly contrasts the threat of death with the enduring power of love and companionship. She proudly concludes that she realized this profound truth of togetherness even before the lover himself could comprehend it.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,1.9],[1.9,2.27],[2.27,2.45],[2.45,2.45],[2.45,2.45],[2.45,3.74],[3.74,5.6],[5.6,6.1],[6.1,6.2],[6.2,7.0],[7.0,7.2],[7.2,7.6],[7.6,8.3],[8.55,9.3],[9.3,9.5],[9.5,10.1],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,10.4],[10.4,10.4],[10.4,10.4],[10.4,13.1],[13.1,13.7],[13.7,14.0],[14.35,14.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,1.6],[1.6,1.9],[1.9,1.9],[1.9,1.9],[1.9,3.6],[3.6,4.2],[4.2,4.2],[4.2,4.2],[4.2,6.4],[6.4,6.5],[6.5,7.6],[7.6,7.8],[7.8,8.2],[8.2,8.9],[9.2,10.1],[10.1,10.3],[10.3,11.1],[11.1,11.59],[11.59,12.3],[12.3,12.9],[12.9,13.5],[13.5,14.83],[14.83,15.4],[15.4,15.42],[15.42,15.48]]}}